      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, what do you mean your brain is stuck in a loop of goblin thoughts? That's a bit of a weird thing to say in a professional consultation. Anyway, can you just finish the part about nitrogen balance? You were saying how the excess energy allows the body to retain amino acids instead of oxidizing them.",
